            "detailed_description": "tiny &amp; Tall: Gleipnir, Part One is a classic yet modern point'n'click adventure, inspired by LucasArt's legendary titles. <br><br>Two barely competent and charmingly inept blacksmiths find themselves contractually bound to the Norse gods and have to explore a lovingly handcrafted world in a quest for unusual and magical objects. But while they look for these ingredients, the sinister gaze of Loki, the Trickster god, casts an evil shadow on their path...<br><br>Solve (not so) convoluted puzzles, talk to eccentric characters and discover an epic Norse legend!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431280/extras/0e86974041b0876b33d1622c3cd3de1a.poster.avif?t=1781884810\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431280/extras/0e86974041b0876b33d1622c3cd3de1a.webm?t=1781884810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431280/extras/0e86974041b0876b33d1622c3cd3de1a.mp4?t=1781884810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Old-school gameplay with a modern realization<br></li><li>A pair of adorable characters, one slightly less so than the other<br></li><li>Lots of jokes, almost none directed against the fourth wall<br></li><li>More than 50 handpainted (on a computer) levels<br></li><li>A unique soundtrack<br></li><li>Scared of opaque point'n'clicks? This one's got an entirely optional clue system<br></li><li>It is pixel art – 1920*1080 of 'em</li></ul>",
